{"url": "https://webaim.org/articles/motor/", "silo": "webaim", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n\t\t<title>WebAIM: Motor Disabilities - Introduction</title>\n\t<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/media/favicon.ico\">\n\t<link rel=\"home\" href=\"/\">\n\t<link rel=\"search\" href=\"/search/\">\n\t<link rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://webaim.org/blog/feed\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"WebAIM Blog\">\n\n\t<script async=\"\" src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-Y41PF8WV9X\"></script>\n\t<script>\n  \twindow.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n  \tfunction gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\n  \tgtag('js', new Date());\n  \tgtag('config', 'G-Y41PF8WV9X');\n\t</script>\n\t\n\t<link href=\"/styles/main.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n\t<link href=\"/styles/print.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"print\">\n\t<script src=\"/media/scripts/jquery.js\"></script>\n\t<script src=\"/media/scripts/main.js\"></script>\n\t<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto:400\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n\t<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Kameron:400,700\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n\t<link href=\"/styles/documents.css?ver=2\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\t\t<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Open+Sans:400,400i,700\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n<!--[if lt IE 9]>\n\t<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"http://html5shiv.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/html5.js\"></script>\n<![endif]-->\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async=\"\" src=\"https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net/pagead/viewthroughconversion/1069381703/?random=1774685960946&amp;cv=11&amp;fst=1774685960946&amp;bg=ffffff&amp;guid=ON&amp;async=1&amp;en=gtag.config&amp;gtm=45je63q0h2v899903185za200zd899903185xec&amp;gcd=13l3l3l3l1l1&amp;dma=0&amp;tag_exp=0~115938465~115938468~117484252&amp;u_w=1080&amp;u_h=600&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwebaim.org%2Farticles%2Fmotor%2F&amp;frm=0&amp;tiba=WebAIM%3A%20Motor%20Disabilities%20-%20Introduction&amp;hn=www.googleadservices.com&amp;npa=0&amp;pscdl=noapi&amp;auid=301195456.1774685902&amp;uaa=x86&amp;uab=64&amp;uafvl=Chromium%3B145.0.7632.6%7CNot%253AA-Brand%3B99.0.0.0&amp;uamb=0&amp;uam=&amp;uap=Linux&amp;uapv=&amp;uaw=0&amp;data=event%3Dgtag.config&amp;rfmt=3&amp;fmt=4\"></script></head>\n<body>\n\n\n<div id=\"headcontainer\" class=\"clearfix\" style=\"background-image: url(/media/banners/articles.jpg)\">\n<header>\n\t<div id=\"skiptocontent\"><a href=\"#maincontent\">skip to main content</a></div>\n\t\n\t<h2><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/media/logo.png\" width=\"630\" height=\"167\" alt=\"WebAIM - Web Accessibility In Mind\"></a></h2>\n\n\t<nav>\n\t\t<h2 class=\"hidden\">Main Navigation</h2>\n\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/articles/\">Articles</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/resources/\">Resources</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/projects/\">Projects</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/community/\">Community</a></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t</nav>\n\t<div id=\"search\">\n\t\t<form method=\"get\" role=\"search\" action=\"/search/\" id=\"sitesearch\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"search\"><span><label for=\"q\">Search:</label> <input type=\"text\" name=\"q\" id=\"q\"><input type=\"image\" src=\"/media/template/search.svg\" alt=\"Submit Search\"></span></p>\n\t\t</form>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p class=\"intro\"><a href=\"/intro\">Introduction to Web Accessibility</a></p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p class=\"training\"><a href=\"/services/training\">WebAIM Training</a></p>\n\t</div>\n\n</header>\n</div>\n\n<main id=\"maincontainer\" class=\"clearfix\">\n\n<article id=\"maincontent\">\n\n<h1>Motor Disabilities<br><span class=\"subtitle\">Introduction</span></h1>\n\n<p id=\"breadcrumbs\"><span class=\"hidden\">You are here: </span><a href=\"/\">Home</a> &gt; <a href=\"/articles/\">Articles</a> &gt; Motor Disabilities</p>\n\n<nav role=\"navigation\">\n\t<h2>Article Contents</h2>\n\t<ol>\n\t\t<li class=\"currentpage\"><span class=\"hidden\">Current page: </span>Page 1: Introduction</li>\n\t\t<li>Page 2: <a href=\"motordisabilities\">Types of Motor Disabilities</a></li>\n\t\t<li>Page 3: <a href=\"assistive\">Assistive Technologies</a></li>\n\t</ol>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"something\">\n\t<h2>\"A Lifeline\"</h2>\n\t<p><img src=\"media/christopher_reeve_mit.jpg\" alt=\"Christopher Reeve\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n\t<p><q><b><i>[The Internet is] an essential tool. And, literally, a lifeline for many disabled people. I have <a href=\"/blog/at-experiment-dragon/\">Dragon Dictate</a>. And while I was in rehab, I learned to operate it by voice. And I have enjoyed corresponding with friends and strangers with that system. Many disabled people have to spend long hours alone. Voice-activated computers are a means of communication that can prevent a sense of isolation.</i></b></q></p>\n\t<p style=\"text-align:right\"><b><i>\u2013 <a href=\"//www.christopherreeve.org/\">Christopher Reeve</a></i></b></p>\n\t<p>Have you ever thought of the Internet as being \"essential\" or a \"lifeline?\" Web content facilitates a high degree of independence for people with disabilities\u2014blogging, reading news, conducting research, publishing articles, purchasing goods and services, participating in the world\u2014as long as the sites and online applications they want to use don't throw barriers in the way.\n</p></div>\n<div id=\"nextpage\"><a href=\"motordisabilities\">Next</a></div>\n</article>\n<!--\n\t-->\n<aside id=\"articlemeta\">\n\n\t<div id=\"updated\">Last updated: <time datetime=\"2020-09-22\">Sep 22, 2020</time></div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"related\">\n\t\t\t<h2>Related Resources</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/intro/\">Introduction to Web Accessibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/techniques/keyboard/\">Keyboard Accessibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/articles/pour/\">Constructing a POUR Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/articles/visual/\">Visual Disabilities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/articles/auditory/\">Auditory Disabilities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/articles/cognitive/\">Cognitive Disabilities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/articles/seizure/\">Seizure and Vestibular Disorders</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n</aside>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n\t<div id=\"footerresources\">\n\t\t<div class=\"footerblock\">\n\t\t\t<h2 id=\"copyright\">\u00a92026 WebAIM</h2>\n\t\t\t<p id=\"contact\">\t\t\tUtah State University<br>\n\t\t\t6807 Old Main Hill<br>\n\t\t\tLogan, UT 84322-6807<br>\n\t\t\t<a class=\"phone\" href=\"tel:4357977024\">435.797.7024</a></p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div id=\"checkpage\">\n\t\t\t<h2>Check Your Accessibility</h2>\n\t\t\t<form action=\"https://wave.webaim.org/report\" novalidate=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t<label for=\"waveurl\">Web site address:</label>\n\t\t\t\t<input type=\"url\" id=\"waveurl\" name=\"url\" title=\"Web site address\">\n\t\t\t\t<input type=\"submit\" value=\"WAVE\">\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"footerblock\">\n\t\t\t<h2 id=\"blog\">From the Blog</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul><li><a href=\"/blog/a-new-path/\">A New Path for Digital Accessibility?</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog/2026-predictions/\">2026 Predictions: The Next Big Shifts in Web Accessibility</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog/word-and-powerpoint-alt-text-roundup/\">Word and PowerPoint Alt Text Roundup</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog/accessibility-by-design/\">Accessibility by Design: Preparing K\u201312 Schools for What\u2019s Next</a></li></ul>\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"footerblock\">\n\t\t\t<h2 id=\"popular\">Popular Resources</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/services/training/\">WebAIM Training</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/standards/wcag/checklist\">WCAG 2 Checklist</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/newsletter\">WebAIM Monthly Newsletter</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/resources/contrastchecker\">Color Contrast Checker</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/resour